{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日（21日）下午，警方接獲《香港01》職員報案，指於葵涌貨櫃碼頭路88號永得利廣場辦公室拆信時，發現有信件藏有粉末，於是報警。</p><p>警員到場調查，並疏散一批職員。</p><p>事故原因及詳情有待調查。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T09:21:08.927148+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T08:39:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T09:17:39.129061+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:17:39.129061+00:00","content_hash":"127e097417fa34bd66b5e4e76e472fee3c82af793b69a9da2886328f4c2f8260","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}